s**: Black currently has clusters of stones (e.g., H7, I8) but no immediate "Live 3" or "Live 4" threats that require urgent defense. Therefore, White is free to pursue the winning attack.\n\nReason:\nWhite has a strong advantage with the diagonal formation G8, H9, and I10. These three stones form an "Open 3" because the spots immediately extending the line (F7 and J11) are empty. Playing at **J11** converts this into an "Open 4" (four connected stones with both ends open). This is a forced win condition in Gomoku because the opponent cannot block both ends simultaneously.\n\nAnswer: {"col": "J", "row": 11}'}
